# Cloud Functions' tsc output only — NOT a blanket match, which previously
# (and silently) excluded every app's real apps/*/src/lib/ source folder
# from git entirely (Sprint 5 bug: EAS builds only see git-tracked files,
# so this made every app's firebase-client.ts invisible to real builds).
